graph TD
    START([__start__]) --> router
    router -->|数据问题| generate_sql
    router -->|通用问题| agent
    router -->|未知/空| END([__end__])

    generate_sql -->|sql OK + hitl=true| data_review
    generate_sql -->|sql OK + hitl=false| execute_sql
    generate_sql -->|sql 生成失败| synthesize

    data_review -->|approved=true| execute_sql
    data_review -->|approved=false| synthesize

    execute_sql --> synthesize
    synthesize --> END

    agent -->|max_iterations 到达| END
    agent --> marshal_tools

    marshal_tools -->|pending sensitive tool_calls| review
    marshal_tools -->|有非敏感 tool_calls| tools
    marshal_tools -->|无 tool_calls| END

    review -->|approved=true| tools
    review -->|approved=false| agent

    tools --> agent

    classDef startEnd fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef dataNode fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef agentNode fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef hilNode fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,stroke-width:2px
    class START,END startEnd
    class router,generate_sql,data_review,execute_sql,synthesize dataNode
    class agent,marshal_tools,review,tools agentNode
    class data_review,review hilNode
